{"id":905,"slug":"the-phantom-of-liberty","title":"The Phantom of Liberty","year":1974,"country":"France","duration":103,"spine":290,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/905-the-phantom-of-liberty","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/c11c7e625fcd444dbe3158d6a601d3ea/rAdJOgdcjncchzq0ENQoPTQw0d7YZx_large.jpg","description":"Luis Buñuel’s vision of the inherent absurdity of human social rituals reaches its taboo-annihilating extreme in what may be his most morally subversive and formally audacious work. Zigzagging across time and space, from the Napoleonic era to the present day, The Phantom of Liberty unfolds as a picaresque, its characters traveling between tableaux in a series of Dadaist non sequiturs. Unbound by the laws of narrative logic, Buñuel lets his surrealist’s id run riot in an exuberant revolt against bourgeois rationality that seems telegraphed directly from his unconscious to the screen. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Luis Buñuel","slug":"luis-bunuel"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Adriana Asti","role":"Sister of the first police commissioner/Lady in black","slug":"adriana-asti"},{"actor":"Julien Bertheau","role":"First police commissioner","slug":"julien-bertheau"},{"actor":"Jean-Claude Brialy","role":"M. Foucauld","slug":"jean-claude-brialy"},{"actor":"Adolfo Celi","role":"M. Legendre’s physician","slug":"adolfo-celi"},{"actor":"Paul Frankeur","role":"Innkeeper","slug":"paul-frankeur"},{"actor":"Michel Lonsdale","role":"Hatter","slug":"michel-lonsdale"},{"actor":"Pierre Maguelon","role":"Policeman","slug":"pierre-maguelon"},{"actor":"François Maistre","role":"Police academy instructor","slug":"francois-maistre"},{"actor":"Michel Piccoli","role":"Second police commissioner","slug":"michel-piccoli"},{"actor":"Hélène Perdrière","role":"Old aunt","slug":"helene-perdriere"},{"actor":"Claude Piéplu","role":"Chief of police","slug":"claude-pieplu"},{"actor":"Jean Rochefort","role":"M. Legendre","slug":"jean-rochefort"},{"actor